+# Internal HTTP Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is HTTPS Everywhere: all connections must use HTTPS encryption, with no plaintext protocol exceptions permitted under any circumstances, including for internal hosts — this policy applies system-wide with no carve-outs and builds on the earlier requirement that certificate verification be enabled on all builds.
